{"title":"Career Roadmap · Food Stylist","role":"Food Stylist","summary":"A Food Stylist designs and prepares food specifically for photography, advertising, films, television, menus, packaging, cookbooks, social media, and digital campaigns. The role combines culinary knowledge with visual composition, lighting, color, texture, plating, photography, and commercial storytelling.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Culinary Science / Bakery & Confectionery"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a Culinary Science / Bakery & Confectionery graduate, this is a strong creative specialization because the student already understands ingredients, food preparation, baking, texture, color, and presentation."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Culinary Science/Bakery & Confectionery → Food Styling Internship/Assistantship → Junior Food Stylist → Food Stylist → Senior/Commercial Food Stylist → Creative Director / Food Styling Consultant"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons: 2026–2046","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Student / Styling Intern"},{"text":"Culinary + visual fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Food Styling Assistant / Junior Stylist"},{"text":"Plating + photography"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Food Stylist"},{"text":"Commercial shoots + portfolio"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Senior Food Stylist"},{"text":"Campaigns + brand work"}],[{"text":"2037–2042"},{"text":"Lead Stylist / Creative Specialist"},{"text":"Creative direction + teams"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Creative Director / Consultant"},{"text":"Brand strategy + independent business"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Culinary foundation"},{"text":"Food preparation, ingredients, color, texture"},{"text":"Plating portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Styling fundamentals"},{"text":"Composition, props, plating, visual balance"},{"text":"Styled food shoots"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Photography + commercial styling"},{"text":"Lighting, camera, editing, art direction"},{"text":"Professional portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 4 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"Advertising, brand shoots, production"},{"text":"Internship + client-style projects"}],[{"text":"Post-graduation"},{"text":"Specialization"},{"text":"Advertising, editorial, packaging or digital content"},{"text":"Professional portfolio + clients"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Master Food Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"A Food Stylist must understand how food behaves."},{"type":"h","text":"Culinary knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Strengthen:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ingredient properties"},{"text":"Cooking methods"},{"text":"Baking"},{"text":"Fermentation"},{"text":"Food chemistry"},{"text":"Emulsions"},{"text":"Sauces"},{"text":"Chocolate"},{"text":"Sugar work"},{"text":"Doughs"},{"text":"Creams"},{"text":"Garnishes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Food behavior"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heat changes color"},{"text":"Sauces behave on camera"},{"text":"Chocolate sets"},{"text":"Ice cream melts"},{"text":"Bread dries"},{"text":"Fruits oxidize"},{"text":"Vegetables lose color"},{"text":"Oils reflect light"},{"text":"Glazes create highlights"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This knowledge is extremely valuable during photography and video shoots."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Learn Food Styling"},{"type":"h","text":"Plating"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Portion control"},{"text":"Color balance"},{"text":"Height"},{"text":"Layering"},{"text":"Negative space"},{"text":"Garnishing"},{"text":"Texture contrast"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visual principles"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Color theory"},{"text":"Balance"},{"text":"Symmetry/asymmetry"},{"text":"Contrast"},{"text":"Scale"},{"text":"Depth"},{"text":"Repetition"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Styling styles"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Minimalist"},{"text":"Rustic"},{"text":"Luxury"},{"text":"Editorial"},{"text":"Commercial"},{"text":"Natural"},{"text":"Lifestyle"},{"text":"Festive"},{"text":"Bakery-focused"}]}]},{"heading":"Food Styling vs Culinary Plating","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are related but not identical."},{"type":"h","text":"Restaurant plating"},{"type":"p","text":"Goal:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Food","customer","eating experience"]},{"type":"h","text":"Food styling"},{"type":"p","text":"Goal:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Food","camera","visual story","audience"]},{"type":"p","text":"A Food Stylist may modify food specifically so that it looks attractive under photography or video conditions."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, the best stylist understands both:"},{"type":"h","text":"Culinary technique + camera behavior"}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Photography","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Photography is one of the most important additional skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Camera fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aperture"},{"text":"Shutter speed"},{"text":"ISO"},{"text":"White balance"},{"text":"Focal length"},{"text":"Depth of field"},{"text":"Focus"},{"text":"Exposure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Composition"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Top-down photography"},{"text":"45-degree shots"},{"text":"Eye-level shots"},{"text":"Close-ups"},{"text":"Macro food photography"},{"text":"Product photography"}]}]},{"heading":"Lighting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Natural light"},{"text":"Window light"},{"text":"Soft light"},{"text":"Hard light"},{"text":"Side lighting"},{"text":"Backlighting"},{"text":"Reflectors"},{"text":"Diffusers"},{"text":"Shadows"},{"text":"Highlights"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how lighting changes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Texture"},{"text":"Gloss"},{"text":"Color"},{"text":"Moisture appearance"},{"text":"Food depth"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good Food Stylist should understand enough photography to collaborate effectively with the photographer."}]},{"heading":"Props and Set Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to select:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plates"},{"text":"Bowls"},{"text":"Cutlery"},{"text":"Glassware"},{"text":"Napkins"},{"text":"Boards"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Backgrounds"},{"text":"Fabrics"},{"text":"Natural elements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Prop selection should support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food type"},{"text":"Brand identity"},{"text":"Color palette"},{"text":"Campaign theme"},{"text":"Target audience"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Premium chocolate brand → darker, sophisticated styling"},{"type":"p","text":"while:"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthy breakfast campaign → brighter, natural lifestyle styling"}]},{"heading":"Year 3–4 — Editing and Digital Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Photo editing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Lightroom"},{"text":"Adobe Photoshop"},{"text":"Capture One concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Graphic design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Figma basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Video"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Food reels"},{"text":"Stop-motion"},{"text":"Product videos"},{"text":"Camera movement"},{"text":"Basic editing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Food styling increasingly includes video, not just still photography."}]},{"heading":"Food Styling Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Main Work","Potential Clients"],"rows":[[{"text":"Advertising Food Styling"},{"text":"Commercial campaigns"},{"text":"Food brands"}],[{"text":"Editorial Styling"},{"text":"Magazines/cookbooks"},{"text":"Publishers"}],[{"text":"Restaurant Styling"},{"text":"Menu photography"},{"text":"Restaurants"}],[{"text":"Bakery Styling"},{"text":"Cakes/pastries"},{"text":"Bakeries"}],[{"text":"Product Styling"},{"text":"Packaged food"},{"text":"FMCG brands"}],[{"text":"Social Media Styling"},{"text":"Reels/posts"},{"text":"Restaurants/brands"}],[{"text":"Packaging Styling"},{"text":"Product photography"},{"text":"Food companies"}],[{"text":"Film/TV Styling"},{"text":"On-screen food"},{"text":"Production houses"}],[{"text":"Recipe Styling"},{"text":"Recipe shoots"},{"text":"Publishers/creators"}],[{"text":"Luxury Food Styling"},{"text":"Premium campaigns"},{"text":"Hotels/luxury brands"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Look for internships with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Food brands"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Packaged food companies"},{"text":"Beverage companies"},{"text":"Chocolate brands"},{"text":"Bakery brands"},{"text":"Restaurant chains"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Photography"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food photographers"},{"text":"Commercial photographers"},{"text":"Advertising studios"},{"text":"Product photography agencies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food magazines"},{"text":"Cookbooks"},{"text":"Recipe websites"},{"text":"Digital food publications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotels"},{"text":"Restaurants"},{"text":"Cafés"},{"text":"Bakeries"},{"text":"Cloud kitchens"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Titles to Search","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food Styling Intern"},{"text":"Food Stylist Assistant"},{"text":"Food Photography Intern"},{"text":"Culinary Styling Intern"},{"text":"Food Content Intern"},{"text":"Recipe Content Intern"},{"text":"Product Photography Intern"},{"text":"Creative Production Intern"},{"text":"Food Content Creator Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The most valuable early experience is often assisting an experienced Food Stylist or photographer on real shoots."}]},{"heading":"Strong Portfolio Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Project","text":"Commercial Food Campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete mock campaign for a fictional food brand."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Premium Chocolate Brand"},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product hero photograph"},{"text":"Lifestyle photograph"},{"text":"Close-up texture shot"},{"text":"Packaging shot"},{"text":"Social-media image"},{"text":"15-second video"},{"text":"Behind-the-scenes image"},{"text":"Campaign mood board"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Concept","Recipe preparation","Styling","Props","Lighting","Photography","Editing"]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates both culinary and commercial capability."}]},{"heading":"Build a Professional Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"table","header":["Portfolio Element","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Hero food photographs"},{"text":"15–20"}],[{"text":"Bakery/pastry images"},{"text":"8–10"}],[{"text":"Product shoots"},{"text":"5"}],[{"text":"Restaurant/menu shoots"},{"text":"5"}],[{"text":"Lifestyle shoots"},{"text":"5"}],[{"text":"Short food videos"},{"text":"5"}],[{"text":"Styled campaign"},{"text":"2–3"}],[{"text":"Behind-the-scenes work"},{"text":"5+"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The portfolio should be visually consistent, not simply a collection of every food photograph you have taken."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize:"},{"type":"h","text":"Culinary"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced food preparation"},{"text":"Baking/pastry"},{"text":"Food presentation"},{"text":"Food safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Photography"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food photography"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Camera operation"},{"text":"Product photography"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Creative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Art direction"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Styling"},{"text":"Set design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Lightroom"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Social-media content production"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are secondary to a strong visual portfolio."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Styling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food Stylist Assistant"},{"text":"Junior Food Stylist"},{"text":"Food Styling Assistant"},{"text":"Culinary Stylist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Content"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food Content Creator"},{"text":"Food Content Executive"},{"text":"Recipe Content Producer"},{"text":"Food Photography Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Photography"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food Photography Assistant"},{"text":"Product Photography Assistant"},{"text":"Commercial Photography Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Creative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creative Production Assistant"},{"text":"Visual Content Assistant"},{"text":"Art Department Assistant"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer / Client Interview Questions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Culinary"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you make a dish look visually appealing?"},{"text":"How does food change during a long photo shoot?"},{"text":"How do you prevent food from losing its visual quality?"},{"text":"How would you style a bakery product?"},{"text":"How do you choose garnishes?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Photography"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Which angle would you use for this dish?"},{"text":"How would you light a glossy product?"},{"text":"How do you create depth in food photography?"},{"text":"How do you control unwanted reflections?"},{"text":"How would you photograph a beverage?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Creative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you interpret a brand brief?"},{"text":"How would you choose props?"},{"text":"How do you create a consistent visual identity?"},{"text":"How would you work with a photographer?"},{"text":"What would you do if the client rejected your styling?"}]}]},{"heading":"Food Styling for Bakery & Confectionery","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This degree provides a particularly strong advantage for bakery styling."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Cakes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Layering"},{"text":"Frosting"},{"text":"Piping"},{"text":"Decoration"},{"text":"Cake slicing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Chocolate"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tempering"},{"text":"Gloss"},{"text":"Texture"},{"text":"Ganache"},{"text":"Chocolate decoration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pastry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Croissants"},{"text":"Danish pastries"},{"text":"Tarts"},{"text":"Choux pastry"},{"text":"Laminated dough"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Bread"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Crust"},{"text":"Crumb"},{"text":"Scoring"},{"text":"Slicing"},{"text":"Steam/moisture appearance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These skills help create authentic, attractive bakery visuals rather than relying only on artificial styling techniques."}]},{"heading":"Food Styling + Social Media","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern Food Stylist should understand short-form content."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instagram Reels"},{"text":"YouTube Shorts"},{"text":"Recipe videos"},{"text":"Product launches"},{"text":"Behind-the-scenes content"},{"text":"Stop-motion food videos"},{"text":"Overhead cooking videos"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful skills:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Styling","Smartphone/Camera","Lighting","Editing","Storytelling"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Food Styling + Advertising","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Commercial food styling requires understanding the brand brief."},{"type":"p","text":"For every project ask:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Who is the target audience?"},{"text":"What is the brand personality?"},{"text":"What is the hero product?"},{"text":"What must be visually emphasized?"},{"text":"What colors represent the brand?"},{"text":"Where will the image be used?"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The same food may need completely different styling for:"},{"type":"p","text":"Luxury advertising vs supermarket packaging vs social media."}]},{"heading":"Freelance / Entrepreneurship Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Food styling is particularly suitable for freelancing."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible services:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food styling"},{"text":"Restaurant menu photography"},{"text":"Product photography"},{"text":"Recipe photography"},{"text":"Social-media content"},{"text":"Food video production"},{"text":"Cookbook photography"},{"text":"Packaging photography"},{"text":"Brand campaigns"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Business progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Assistant","Freelance Stylist","Regular Brand Clients","Food Creative Studio"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not mandatory for becoming a Food Stylist."},{"type":"p","text":"If pursuing further education, useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Food Science"},{"text":"Food Technology"},{"text":"Culinary Arts"},{"text":"Hospitality Management"},{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"Visual Communication"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Digital Media"},{"text":"Design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, professional portfolio + real production experience generally matter more than obtaining another academic qualification solely for food styling."}]},{"heading":"Food Science + Styling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The science background can become a competitive advantage."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food oxidation"},{"text":"Emulsions"},{"text":"Maillard reaction"},{"text":"Caramelization"},{"text":"Gel formation"},{"text":"Crystallization"},{"text":"Moisture migration"},{"text":"Texture"},{"text":"Food color"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This allows the stylist to predict how food will behave during a shoot."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Ice cream","studio lighting","long shoot → melting problem"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A food stylist needs to anticipate and manage that problem."}]},{"heading":"AI + Food Styling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mood-board generation"},{"text":"Concept development"},{"text":"Background ideation"},{"text":"Campaign variations"},{"text":"Content planning"},{"text":"Image editing"},{"text":"Visual experimentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, commercial food brands often require the actual product to remain truthful."},{"type":"p","text":"A stylist should therefore understand the distinction between:"},{"type":"p","text":"Creative enhancement and misleading product representation."},{"type":"p","text":"Human expertise remains important for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Real food preparation"},{"text":"Texture"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Styling"},{"text":"Brand accuracy"},{"text":"On-set problem solving"}]}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Food styling is likely to expand beyond traditional photography."},{"type":"h","text":"Immersive food content"},{"type":"p","text":"More use of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D"},{"text":"AR"},{"text":"VR"},{"text":"Interactive product experiences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted production"},{"type":"p","text":"AI may accelerate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creative concepts"},{"text":"Backgrounds"},{"text":"Layout variations"},{"text":"Campaign testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Video-first food styling"},{"type":"p","text":"More demand for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reels"},{"text":"Short-form ads"},{"text":"Product videos"},{"text":"Streaming content"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable styling"},{"type":"p","text":"Brands may increasingly emphasize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable ingredients"},{"text":"Low-waste shoots"},{"text":"Natural props"},{"text":"Reusable production materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Culinary"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food preparation"},{"text":"Baking"},{"text":"Pastry"},{"text":"Food chemistry"},{"text":"Ingredient behavior"},{"text":"Food safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Styling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plating"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Color theory"},{"text":"Props"},{"text":"Set design"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Photography"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Camera operation"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Food photography"},{"text":"Product photography"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Lightroom"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Social-media production"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Creative briefs"},{"text":"Art direction"},{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Team collaboration"},{"text":"Budget awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industry proof"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"1–2 food-styling internships"},{"text":"30–50 strong portfolio photographs"},{"text":"3 commercial-style campaigns"},{"text":"5+ food videos"},{"text":"Bakery/pastry portfolio"},{"text":"Restaurant/menu shoot"},{"text":"Product photography project"},{"text":"Professional portfolio website/social presence"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Culinary + food science foundation","Year 2: Plating + styling + visual composition","Year 3: Photography + lighting + props + editing","Year 4: Commercial styling + internship + portfolio","Graduate: Food Styling Assistant / Junior Food Stylist","2–5 years: Food Stylist / Commercial Food Stylist","5–10 years: Senior Food Stylist / Lead Stylist","10–20 years: Creative Director / Food Styling Consultant / Studio Owner"],"label":"Year 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Best profile by graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Culinary Science/Bakery & Confectionery + strong culinary skills + food styling + plating + food photography + lighting + props/set design + Photoshop/Lightroom + video content + 30–50 piece professional portfolio + real shoot experience."},{"type":"p","text":"This combination opens pathways into food advertising, restaurant photography, bakery and confectionery brands, cookbooks, magazines, FMCG product campaigns, social-media content, film/TV production, and independent food-styling businesses."},{"type":"p","text":"959 | UG | Science | B.Sc (General / Honours) | Hospitality Science | Front Office Associate"}]}]}